OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto wall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fdangerous driving after a car crashed
OL,8,Finto a wall in Wollaton.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called at around 01:40 BST on
OL,12,FSunday, after a red Mercedes "collided
OL,13,Fwith a wall" between the entrance to
OL,14,FWollaton Hall and Bramcote Lane.
OL,16,FA woman found injured is in a critical
OL,17,Fcondition at Queen's Medical Centre in
OL,18,FNottingham, a force statement said.
OL,20,FThe arrested man, who is 29 years old,
OL,21,Fis also currently in hospital with
OL,22,F"serious injuries".
